{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "CosmosAI learning export", "elements": [{"id": "title", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 40, "width": 760, "height": 38, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 38001, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 3800101, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1786720000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a0", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Milestone 38: Tiny Checkpoint Inference Command", "fontSize": 30, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Milestone 38: Tiny Checkpoint Inference Command", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "subtitle", "type": "text", "x": 65, "y": 92, "width": 1100, "height": 44, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 38002, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 3800202, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1786720000000, "link": "/learn/concepts/", "locked": false, "index": "a1", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Inference loads saved weights and predicts. It does not calculate loss, gradients, or optimizer updates.", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Inference loads saved weights and predicts. It does not calculate loss, gradients, or optimizer updates.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "command", "type": "text", "x": 70, "y": 170, "width": 1220, "height": 245, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#fff3bf", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 38003, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 3800303, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1786720000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a2", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Command-line flow\n\nmain()\n  -> predict_from_checkpoint(manifest, data_root, image_id, checkpoint)\n       -> load_sample_for_prediction(...)\n       -> predict_sample_from_checkpoint(...)\n            -> load_torch_checkpoint(checkpoint)\n            -> run_torch_forward_pass(sample, loaded_model)\n       -> print_prediction(...)", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Command-line flow\n\nmain()\n  -> predict_from_checkpoint(manifest, data_root, image_id, checkpoint)\n       -> load_sample_for_prediction(...)\n       -> predict_sample_from_checkpoint(...)\n            -> load_torch_checkpoint(checkpoint)\n            -> run_torch_forward_pass(sample, loaded_model)\n       -> print_prediction(...)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "checkpoint", "type": "text", "x": 70, "y": 470, "width": 330, "height": 215, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#e5dbff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 38004, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 3800404, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1786720000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a3", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Checkpoint input\n\nmodels/tiny_galaxy_cnn_baseline.pt\n\nload_torch_checkpoint()\n\nConcept:\nloads saved state_dict weights into a fresh TinyGalaxyCNN.", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Checkpoint input\n\nmodels/tiny_galaxy_cnn_baseline.pt\n\nload_torch_checkpoint()\n\nConcept:\nloads saved state_dict weights into a fresh TinyGalaxyCNN.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "sample", "type": "text", "x": 445, "y": 470, "width": 330, "height": 215, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#d0ebff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 38005, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 3800505, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1786720000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a4", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Sample input\n\ngz2-000001\n\nload_sample_for_prediction()\n\nConcept:\nmanifest row -> image path -> normalized tensor.\nLabel is printed only for learning.", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Sample input\n\ngz2-000001\n\nload_sample_for_prediction()\n\nConcept:\nmanifest row -> image path -> normalized tensor.\nLabel is printed only for learning.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "forward", "type": "text", "x": 820, "y": 470, "width": 330, "height": 215, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 38006, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 3800606, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1786720000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a5", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Inference forward pass\n\npredict_sample_from_checkpoint()\n\nConcept:\nimage tensor + loaded weights -> logits -> probabilities.\n\nNo loss.backward().\nNo optimizer.step().", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Inference forward pass\n\npredict_sample_from_checkpoint()\n\nConcept:\nimage tensor + loaded weights -> logits -> probabilities.\n\nNo loss.backward().\nNo optimizer.step().", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "output", "type": "text", "x": 1195, "y": 470, "width": 330, "height": 215, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffe3e3", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 38007, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 3800707, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1786720000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a6", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Prediction output\n\nprint_prediction()\n\npredicted_label_id: 1\npredicted_label: spiral\nprobabilities:\n[0.2842, 0.3521, 0.1696, 0.1942]", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Prediction output\n\nprint_prediction()\n\npredicted_label_id: 1\npredicted_label: spiral\nprobabilities:\n[0.2842, 0.3521, 0.1696, 0.1942]", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "boundary", "type": "text", "x": 70, "y": 745, "width": 1050, "height": 165, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#f1f3f5", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 38008, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 3800808, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1786720000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a7", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Boundary\n\nReal now: local checkpoint inference command.\nNot real yet: FastAPI service loading checkpoint, real uploaded images, useful trained model.\n\nNext: prepare galaxy-classifier-service for optional checkpoint inference while keeping stub fallback.", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Boundary\n\nReal now: local checkpoint inference command.\nNot real yet: FastAPI service loading checkpoint, real uploaded images, useful trained model.\n\nNext: prepare galaxy-classifier-service for optional checkpoint inference while keeping stub fallback.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}, "files": {}}